@apiDocument(#{`openapi`:"3.1.0",`info`:#{`title`:"IYA STS Sign-in API",`version`:"0.0.0",`description`:"The sign-in screen's API: what the screen offers for a pending sign-in, and the acts it sends. Unauthenticated and keyed by the pending sign-in's id; every act is bound to the browser's session cookie by a CSRF token. Answers name the next step; refusals are English and carry no error code. And the sign-out page's (#577): what a sign-out would end for the person the session names, and the act that ends it."},`servers`:#[#{`url`:""}],`tags`:#[#{`name`:"Sign-in"}],`x-iya-doc`:"authn"})
