@endpoint("/authn-api/mfa/{id}/start-over", "post", #{`operationId`:"startOver",`tags`:#["Sign-in"],`summary`:"Leaves a sign-in step and starts the sign-in over",`description`:"Every second-factor, set-up and emailed-factor page's Start over button. The step is ended with whatever it held (an emailed code, a link, an enrolment in progress), no session is started and no factor is counted, and the pending sign-in the step was minted from is put back under its id, so the request it carries completes after the person signs in again. `next: redirect` to the sign-in screen; a step that has already ended is refused (400).\n\nThe door of the sign-in surface's `POST /authn/totp, /authn/webauthn, /authn/backup-code, /authn/password-factor, /authn/mfa-setup, /authn/email-code, /authn/email-link, /authn/email-link/open`.\n\nSent with `Content-Type: application/json`, an `Origin` of this service and `X-CSRF-Token` — the `csrf` the page's view answered, bound to the browser's `sts_session` cookie.",`parameters`:#[#{`name`:"id",`in`:"path",`required`:true,`description`:"The second-factor or emailed-factor step's id: a bearer capability, as the `mfa` its page was opened with.",`schema`:null}],`responses`:#{`200`:#{`description`:"The answer.",`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}},`400`:#{`description`:"Refused: `{ ok: false, errors }` — the body, the id, or the act itself.",`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}},`403`:#{`description`:"No Origin of this service, or no CSRF token bound to this browser's session.",`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}},`415`:#{`description`:"Not a JSON body.",`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}},`429`:#{`description`:"Too many attempts.",`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}},`default`:#{`description`:"A refusal or a failure.",`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}}},`security`:#[],`requestBody`:#{`required`:true,`content`:#{`application/json`:#{`schema`:null}}},`x-mirrors`:"POST /authn/totp, /authn/webauthn, /authn/backup-code, /authn/password-factor, /authn/mfa-setup, /authn/email-code, /authn/email-link, /authn/email-link/open"})
